{
  "id": "site_theta",
  "title": "Site Theta",
  "premise": "A xenobiology black site under a pine forest. Specimen 4 has learned the night shift's routines and tonight it leaves.",
  "design_notes": "Route A (vents and hacking): liquefy, ooze into maintenance, absorb technician Ruiz for the server password, log into the server terminal, open the exhaust duct and ride the supply truck out after turn 18. Route B (disguise): absorb Dr. Ito when she checks the cell, badge out as her, con Officer Hale into opening the checkpoint, crack the security terminal and walk out the perimeter gate. Route C: take the Director's master key and use it on the dock shutter and gate. Guards shoot on sight, the cell incinerator cycles during lockdown, and alarms revoke stolen badges and seal the vents.",
  "turn_limit": 40,
